{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_hanging

    What hangs from the knob of a child, by the age its course starts at (panel::hanging_object, from the ladder of
    data/escalera.json), each step less childish, and each with its own outline: the small round backpack with the name
    on its big label (mochila); the tall school backpack with its bottle out of the side pocket, the name still on a
    label (escolar); the sporty backpack, wider below, with a reflective stripe, a ball on its zip and the name on a card
    in a clear holder (figura); the narrow flat backpack with the name on the plate of its key ring (llavero); the
    luggage tag of cream card on its cord (equipaje); and the card on a lanyard with the name printed (credencial, and
    credencial-neutra with a plain lanyard). All hang from the same knob and swing the same; a little crooked, each its
    own way. All are drawn and the class of the svg shows one (pub/panel.css); without object, the backpack. A drawing
    only: the name is written beside it.

    Example context (json):
    {"name": "Leo", "style": "--reposo:-3.5deg", "object": "figura"}
}}
